<title>UK: Carlton divisional results -- a breakdown.</title>
<headline>Carlton divisional results -- a breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>British broadcaster Carlton Communications Plc on Wednesday raised half-year, pre-tax profits 11 percent to 158.6 million stg after a small exceptional loss.</p>
<p>Following is a breakdown of divisional turnover and operating profit. Figures are in millions of pounds.</p>
<p>			 Half year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		TURNOVER  Growth   OPERATING PROFIT   Growth</p>
<p>TV		407     +18 pct	 72.6	    +19 pct</p>
<p>Video	   242.4   -12 pct	 36.2	     -2 pct</p>
<p>Film	    148.6    +1 pct	 28.8	    +10 pct</p>
<p>Processing     93.2   +24 pct	 26.2	    +28 pct</p>
<p>Other	     4.8    -2 pct	  5.1 loss	-4 pct</p>
<p>TOTAL	   896.0    +6 pct	 158.7	   +13 pct</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7987</p>
